Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.45,0:00:13.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出現在夢裡的是只在夢裡存在的哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.46,0:00:19.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想乘上純白的紙飛機在那無限蔚藍的世界中翱翔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.69,0:00:21.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,騙人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.91,0:00:24.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們人好 一定是在騙我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.90,0:00:27.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…回來了!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:29.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.99,0:00:33.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盡全力去做現在能做的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.37,0:00:46.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重複了無數次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:53.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直致力於同一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.27,0:00:58.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…又要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:01.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論多少次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.31,0:01:06.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.02,0:01:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有誰…在呼喊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.67,0:01:28.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喊什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:54.35,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}一人じゃさみしい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.04,0:02:00.66,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}だから手を繋いだんだっけ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.56,0:02:11.64,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}それじゃいつまでも 子供のままだ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:19.37,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}どうしても伝えたかったんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.93,0:02:25.44,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}繋いだ手はもう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.09,0:02:32.02,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}バラバラになる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.25,0:02:35.81,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}一つずつ消えていく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.93,0:02:42.49,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}目覚める日へ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.03,0:02:52.12,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}とっとと走って行け
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.26,0:03:06.86,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}祭りのあとのようで さみしいだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:54.35,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}一個人太孤單
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.04,0:02:00.66,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}才會牽起彼此的手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.56,0:02:11.64,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}但這樣只會讓人無法成長
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:19.37,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}無論如何我都要告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.93,0:02:25.44,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}牽起的手就要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.09,0:02:32.02,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}四散分離
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.25,0:02:35.81,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}逐一消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.93,0:02:42.49,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}向著夢醒之日
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.03,0:02:52.12,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}大步向前吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.26,0:03:06.86,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}恰如曲終人散時 空剩寂寥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.21,0:03:14.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.07,0:03:16.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:17.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.02,0:03:19.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.22,0:03:25.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比賽後拍的照啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.69,0:03:27.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都相當上鏡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.32,0:03:29.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 那可是最棒的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.24,0:03:31.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.37,0:03:34.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我不甘心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.18,0:03:37.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖說是第一次打比賽 我還是想贏的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.75,0:03:39.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就差那麼一點
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 誰讓你個白癡在得分點上被三振
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.64,0:03:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說啥 明明是因為你跑防守時摔了個嘴啃泥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.55,0:03:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是因為我踩到石子了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.67,0:03:50.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰讓你赤著腳跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.15,0:03:51.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你們
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.58,0:03:52.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.08,0:03:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幫忙做準備
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.60,0:03:56.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 就等你這句話了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.39,0:03:58.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又要搞啥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.04,0:04:02.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由小毬同學主辦的烤餅派對啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:17.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫醬 用你那邊的鐵碗攪下雞蛋和麵粉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.23,0:04:20.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嗆人…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.01,0:04:27.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 庫醬…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.81,0:04:30.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫公還是這麼大氣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:33.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 氣勢足得很
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.63,0:04:39.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟這是咱們Little Busters第一次搞全體派對
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我們就幫忙裝潢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:45.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:46.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把這些掛起來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.79,0:04:50.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來造煙!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.66,0:04:52.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意料之外的乾冰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.45,0:04:53.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.62,0:04:54.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,興奮過頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:56.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:04:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飲料買來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.06,0:05:00.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.14,0:05:02.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀呀呀 小的們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.12,0:05:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備工作做得怎麼樣啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.15,0:05:07.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了個什麼忙都沒幫的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.01,0:05:09.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉呀 鈴醬
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.98,0:05:14.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別這麼說嘛 待會兒我會拿根棒棒糖給你舔的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.31,0:05:18.40,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,停…停手!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.40,0:05:49.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備工作差不多OK了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:51.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慶宴開始!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.49,0:05:53.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬同學請發言吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:57.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生們女士們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.57,0:06:00.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初次棒球賽 真是青春了一回啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.05,0:06:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,諸多笑容 諸多幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:12.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我在此宣佈首屆烤餅派對正式開始
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.18,0:06:18.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請各位用力吃 用力喝 用力讚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.59,0:06:21.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.66,0:06:23.62,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,一 二 Little Busters…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.55,0:06:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肌肉耶耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.10,0:06:28.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Little Busters 最讚!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.51,0:06:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,儘是些白癡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.54,0:06:39.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來來 請品嚐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.34,0:06:42.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃死了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.38,0:06:45.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會拚命烤的 你們儘管吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.81,0:06:50.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那塊是葉留親的!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:52.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑 那是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢著
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.63,0:07:00.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,友情!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.88,0:07:02.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家分著吃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:05.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太厲害了～
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.95,0:07:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宮澤同學以前不是這樣的吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.65,0:07:13.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說他跳樓時撞到哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.95,0:07:18.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他撞出了一身槽點 現在簡直有趣極了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.57,0:07:20.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.43,0:07:21.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.30,0:07:22.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,味道不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:23.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.39,0:07:27.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說來這還是第一次吃到你親手做的料理呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.19,0:07:31.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,燒下一塊了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都喜歡什麼料?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.34,0:07:39.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蜂蜜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.55,0:07:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大愛滿滿的木莓醬
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.78,0:07:43.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,推薦杏仁醬
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.23,0:07:45.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只愛蛋黃醬
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.04,0:07:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海蘊如何
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.71,0:07:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海蘊?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.75,0:07:52.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而這個就是將所有醬料混合後的產物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.32,0:07:59.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 為啥要餵給我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.16,0:08:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烤餅派對非常成功呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.45,0:08:07.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.34,0:08:40.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好撐呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:42.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再也吃不下了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.50,0:08:45.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來是我贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.57,0:08:49.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不像話 我肚子還餓著呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.13,0:08:53.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩得真開心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.52,0:08:56.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過派對結束時有些寂寞就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.11,0:08:59.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小麥粉也要咕嚕咕嚕地攪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.69,0:09:00.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咕嚕咕嚕?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.75,0:09:01.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:05.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 少年
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.29,0:09:13.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想到 大家能像這樣一起玩鬧的時光只會越來越少…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.31,0:09:17.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不論什麼故事都會迎來終局
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:21.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會分崩離析…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.82,0:09:23.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.09,0:09:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小人們道過別 然後一個接一個地消失
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.21,0:09:30.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.99,0:09:37.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事 是我想多了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:54.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶吶 鈴醬
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.55,0:09:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.35,0:09:57.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴醬喜歡吃什麼甜點呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.07,0:09:56.06,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,西園同學 拍的照也給我看下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.45,0:09:58.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甜點啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:04.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來谷唯湖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:06.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓人作嘔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.91,0:10:10.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶 為什麼那麼討厭來谷同學呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.37,0:10:14.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高一時她嗤笑過我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.94,0:10:16.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不論幹什麼她都嘲諷我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:21.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜她所賜 班上的人也開始看不起我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:31.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不會輕饒了她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.57,0:11:16.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和往常一樣 稀鬆平凡的時光悄然流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:24.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可…為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.52,0:11:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會如此不安呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:39.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忘掉了一些…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.12,0:11:42.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.71,0:12:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶 今天幾號來著
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.03,0:12:08.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那裡不是有寫嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.69,0:12:10.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的小冊子!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.40,0:12:13.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天20號
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.48,0:12:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的小冊子…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.01,0:12:17.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.48,0:12:18.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真心抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.15,0:12:19.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒那麼嚴重啦 真人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.46,0:12:19.88,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這雨下得夠久了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.49,0:12:24.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣一直下 明天也練不成棒球了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.96,0:12:27.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新聞播報完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.63,0:12:29.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以下播送6月20日的天氣預報
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.26,0:12:33.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下午6時前的降水率為70%…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.03,0:12:35.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.52,0:12:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我來一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:51.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹君…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.12,0:12:53.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出什麼事了?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.44,0:12:57.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們看啊 有人往庫特公的書包裡放了一大堆圖釘
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.45,0:13:00.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:02.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鞋子裡也有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.05,0:13:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰幹的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.52,0:13:06.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.53,0:13:11.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…不介意的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.66,0:13:13.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是你介不介意的問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.33,0:13:16.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫醬 沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.74,0:13:19.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神北
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.91,0:13:23.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也有事瞞著我們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.00,0:13:28.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 小毬醬
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.22,0:13:30.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.49,0:13:33.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.85,0:13:41.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.32,0:13:47.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是誰幹的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.27,0:13:49.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒人有線索嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.06,0:14:27.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她那表情真心解氣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.40,0:14:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶 做這種事沒意義的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.40,0:14:34.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是停手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:37.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怕什麼啊 睦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.17,0:14:39.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可別給誰打小報告
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.22,0:14:42.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你們啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.32,0:14:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啥 說什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:48.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往庫特的書包裡放圖釘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.46,0:14:50.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撕爛小毬同學的筆記
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.60,0:14:51.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們為什麼這麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.95,0:14:55.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼呢 我們可不知情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.53,0:14:58.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有證據證明是我們幹的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.30,0:15:00.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有本事拿證據出來嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.68,0:15:06.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我往能美的書包裡放了圖釘
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.09,0:15:08.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好樣的 好樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.26,0:15:10.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼是能美同學
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.07,0:15:13.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們恨的不是來谷同學嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.31,0:15:16.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這點套路那傢伙根本不吃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.55,0:15:18.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要讓她周圍的人明白
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.80,0:15:22.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和來谷親近就會吃苦頭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.61,0:15:24.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先把來谷孤立出來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.80,0:15:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再說了 那傢伙根本不可能交到朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.06,0:15:34.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明就是個不論怎麼騷擾都無動於衷的怪物 機器人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.20,0:15:40.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來谷同學…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以上 你們要的證據在此
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.23,0:15:46.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,繼續反駁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.72,0:15:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…等…這…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.43,0:15:51.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「啊…等…這…」?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.50,0:15:52.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是哪國語?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.47,0:15:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請務必用我能聽懂的七國語言之一發言
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.53,0:16:02.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也罷 這段錄音已能證明你們二人是主犯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:07.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另一個只是在場 沒有動手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.21,0:16:11.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過只是旁觀 不予制止也是同罪就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.27,0:16:18.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 我該怎麼料理你們呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:21.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不止剛剛放給你們的那一段
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你們的整個陰謀來個全校廣播怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.49,0:16:28.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 竊聽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.95,0:16:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你個違法者
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.61,0:16:34.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不承認你們有值得維護的人權
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.23,0:16:38.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是饒不了你 你的存在讓我覺得礙眼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.70,0:16:43.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不是你 去年整個班都是我的天下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.70,0:16:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊 有種你就去廣播
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:50.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你敢放 我就把你們那群人都毀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.96,0:16:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們關係蠻好對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.58,0:16:56.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要搞破壞 方法多得是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.73,0:17:00.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會一直搞到你們散伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.43,0:17:05.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還不快說「是我錯了 請你高抬貴手 高宮同學」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.32,0:17:06.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…死你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.28,0:17:09.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啥 給我大聲點
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.42,0:17:11.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…弄死你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.60,0:17:12.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啥!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.01,0:17:14.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當心我弄死你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:29.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才那一腳踢在你們面門上怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:33.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,估計你們以後再也不敢照鏡子了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.21,0:17:40.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在的我根本不在乎變成殺人犯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:43.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒打算聽你們的謝罪之辭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.15,0:17:49.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怕了 就永遠別再惹我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.00,0:17:50.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們這群…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.01,0:17:52.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,渣滓!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不打算追究你的責任 所以別再攙和進來了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.35,0:18:08.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對…對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.93,0:18:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是啥情況
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.57,0:18:16.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.44,0:18:19.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概猜得到發生了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.83,0:18:21.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之先清掃一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:23.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老師來了!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.82,0:18:26.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來谷 理樹 這裡交給我們
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:29.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當事人最好不在現場
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.69,0:18:32.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:34.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰幹的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:38.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來繼續分高下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.57,0:18:40.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 求之不得
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:42.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.07,0:18:45.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.27,0:18:47.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 還不住手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.39,0:18:48.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.14,0:18:48.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:50.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面 面!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.97,0:18:52.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欠你們一個人情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.00,0:19:01.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家在爭取不讓我們陷入困境
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.92,0:19:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我並不在乎接受處分
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.81,0:19:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過夥伴們的心意是必須領的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.22,0:19:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還是頭一次看到來谷同學氣成那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.07,0:19:45.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:48.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來我 也會生氣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.44,0:19:52.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直認為自己沒有感情
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:55.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,借別人的話說 是機器人似的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.93,0:19:57.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論被怎麼騷擾都無動於衷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.16,0:20:02.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來谷同學才不是什麼機器人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.17,0:20:06.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你之所以生那麼大氣 是因為你太在乎我們了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.32,0:20:10.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人情味濃濃的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.37,0:20:14.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人情味…嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.53,0:20:22.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論針對什麼 我的心都未曾動搖過
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.80,0:20:26.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…直到成為你們的夥伴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.65,0:20:33.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,進來喝杯茶吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:38.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.59,0:20:40.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,廣播室
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.33,0:20:44.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別看我這樣 我可是廣播委員
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.55,0:21:12.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…來過…這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.90,0:21:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「別看我這樣 我可是廣播委員」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.74,0:21:27.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們進行過…同樣的對話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.35,0:21:31.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要忘記…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.53,0:21:37.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想永遠待在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.26,0:21:43.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之後 「那個」又突然襲來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.46,0:21:46.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突發性急睡症
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:51.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它還是那麼突如其來地
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.89,0:21:55.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斬斷了我與這個世界的聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.49,0:22:08.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)\pos(740,350)\bord0\1c&HFFFFFF&\fsp15}第1話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.49,0:22:08.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)\an6\pos(818,380)\bord0\1c&HFFFFFF&\fsp15}它突如其來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.27,0:23:35.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,廣播室裡充滿了雨的氣息
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.80,0:23:39.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 彼時雨亦落
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.02,0:22:19.51,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}なくしたもの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.51,0:22:23.10,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}大切なこと 守れなかった僕らの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.10,0:22:26.63,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}笑顔の影　この先いつか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.63,0:22:30.23,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}晴れること祈ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.23,0:22:33.79,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}時間は過ぎ　今日の終りは
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:37.51,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}当たり前にやってくる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.51,0:22:40.97,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}「じゃあまたね」と見送る背中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.97,0:22:44.67,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}本当は「また」なんてない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.81,0:22:48.01,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}誰かの知らない街
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.43,0:22:51.76,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}僕らはそこで出会って
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.98,0:22:58.89,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}いつからか風は　いつもそこにふいてた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.28,0:23:04.29,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}でも僕は君じゃないから
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.29,0:23:07.95,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}伝えることしか出来なくて
